    "description": {
      "content": "The API Fiddle API provides programmatic access to the API Fiddle design platform, enabling management of projects, specifications, workspaces, sharing, and export capabilities. It allows developers to automate API design workflows, collaborate on OpenAPI specifications, and integrate API Fiddle into their development pipelines.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: API Fiddle",
